ent-AU14WeaponSMGXMP5A6HAZOPS = XMP5A6/10 CQW
    .desc = Chambered in 10x24mm and compatible with M41A Mk2 magazines, including armor-piercing magazines. Winner of the 2172 HAZOPS Close Quarters Weapon program, this German-made machine pistol combines a high rate of fire and impressive stopping power with limited accuracy.
